<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page photo-history-page qd-theme qd-home"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="heading">每一餐，都有记录</view><view class="history-intro">已完成的识别会保留原照片和营养分析；点击餐食查看完整报告。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><view class="empty">照片与报告仅自己可见</view><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">登录查看拍照识餐历史</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!photos.length}}" class="card section empty"><image class="history-empty-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/ai-plan.png"/><view class="empty-title">等你记录第一餐</view><view>拍下这一餐，把每一点改变留下来。</view></view><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="id" class="history-card"><view class="row"><text class="history-slot">{{item.slotLabel}}</text><text class="history-date">{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="history-meal" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openReport"><image class="history-thumb" src="{{item.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill" data-path="{{item.imagePath}}" catchtap="preview"/><view class="grow"><view class="history-name">{{item.name || '未识别到餐食'}}</view><view class="history-status">{{item.legacy ? '原照片与饮食记录已保存' : '原照片与分析报告已保存'}}</view></view><view class="history-kcal">{{item.kcalLabel}}<text class="history-unit"> kcal</text></view></view><view class="history-actions"><button class="history-delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button><button class="history-report" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openReport">{{item.legacy ? '查看当天日记' : '查看完整分析'}}<text class="history-arrow"> ›</text></button></view></view><view class="history-footnote">识别结果是照片估算值，历史报告不会自动更改。</view></block><button class="btn section" data-url="/pages/photo/index" bindtap="go">拍照记录新的一餐</button></block></view>